{"id":"n62344-1-11","stage":3,"title":"넓히다 · 扩大","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62344-1-11-1","ko":"이 집에서 다섯 명이 살기는 좀 좁은데.","zh":"这房子住五个人确实有点窄。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"房子，窝，巢","explanation":"집：房子，窝，巢；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"1","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다섯","meaning":"五","explanation":"다섯：五","readings":[{"term":"다섯","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58111","senseId":"1","lemma":"다섯","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"명이","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"살기는","meaning":"住，生活","explanation":"살다：住，生活；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"살다","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69579","senseId":"10","lemma":"살다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좁은데.","meaning":"窄小","explanation":"좁다：窄小；은데：在句末提出背景、感想或含蓄的对照，留有后续语意；非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"좁다","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75801","senseId":"1","lemma":"좁다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"房子，窝，巢","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"人或动物为了遮寒挡暑等，进里面生活而盖的建筑物。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"0d616c5afd4feb13","term":"다섯","zh":"五","audio":"/audio/0d616c5afd4feb1394a9.mp3","entryId":"58111","definition":"四加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["다섣"]},{"id":"9f96b8e22cc06bfa","term":"명","zh":"个，名","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3","entryId":"70812","definition":"计算人数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["명"]},{"id":"12dad67abf287f9a","term":"살다","zh":"住，生活","audio":"/audio/12dad67abf287f9a30d4.mp3","entryId":"69579","definition":"在某处居住或停留。","pronunciation":["살ː다"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一点点，有一点","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"分量或程度稀少地。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"19959a056b2a4242","term":"좁다","zh":"窄小","audio":"/audio/19959a056b2a424243d6.mp3","entryId":"75801","definition":"面或底部等的面积小。","pronunciation":["좁따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8e26cac160f36e9bfa34.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62344-1-11-2","ko":"그래서 방을 몇 개 더 짓고 거실을 넓히는 공사를 하려고.","zh":"所以打算再建几间房，同时把客厅扩宽。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방을","meaning":"房间","explanation":"방：房间；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"방","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29724","senseId":"1","lemma":"방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개","meaning":"个","explanation":"개：个","readings":[{"term":"개","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22784","senseId":"1","lemma":"개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"짓고","meaning":"做，造，建","explanation":"짓다：做，造，建；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"짓다","audio":"/audio/e17bf0fed41df779832d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66585","senseId":"1","lemma":"짓다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거실을","meaning":"客厅","explanation":"거실：客厅；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"거실","audio":"/audio/f75d2664aecb37c813ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66304","senseId":"1","lemma":"거실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"넓히는","meaning":"扩大，扩建","explanation":"넓히다：扩大，扩建；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"넓히다","audio":"/audio/1870e0478420ed121180.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62344","senseId":"1","lemma":"넓히다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"공사를","meaning":"工程，施工","explanation":"공사：工程，施工；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공사","audio":"/audio/25e51843741edb403b41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23401","senseId":"1","lemma":"공사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하려고.","meaning":"表示实现前面动作的想法。","explanation":"하다：表示实现前面动作的想法。；려고：非敬语地表达打算，或根据语调询问意图。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"76102fe82462d111","term":"방","zh":"房间","audio":"/audio/76102fe82462d111be2a.mp3","entryId":"29724","definition":"人为了生活或工作而用墙壁围绕和外界隔绝的空间。","pronunciation":["방"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/au